#: ../../validation.rst:4
msgid "Scientific validation"
msgstr "Validação científica"

#: ../../validation.rst:6
msgid ""
"The Lyapunov exponent computation in ``chaotic_pfc`` has been numerically"
" validated against published reference values from the scientific "
"literature and against an analytical mathematical identity."
msgstr ""
"O cálculo de expoentes de Lyapunov do ``chaotic_pfc`` foi validado "
"numericamente contra valores de referência publicados na literatura "
"científica e contra uma identidade matemática analítica."

#: ../../validation.rst:11
msgid "Reference values"
msgstr "Valores de referência"

#: ../../validation.rst:13
msgid ""
"The following table summarises the Lyapunov spectrum of the generalised "
"Hénon map (:math:`\\alpha = 1.4`, :math:`\\beta = 0.3`) , equivalent to "
"the standard Hénon (:math:`a = 1.4`, :math:`b = 0.3`) under a linear "
"change of variables , as reported by independent sources, alongside the "
"value computed by :func:`~chaotic_pfc.dynamics.lyapunov.lyapunov_henon2d`"
" with :math:`N_{\\text{itera}} = 20\\,000` and seed 42."
msgstr ""
"A tabela a seguir resume o espectro de Lyapunov do mapa de Hénon padrão "
"(:math:`a = 1.4`, :math:`b = 0.3`) conforme reportado por fontes "
"independentes, junto ao valor calculado por "
":func:`~chaotic_pfc.dynamics.lyapunov.lyapunov_henon2d` com "
":math:`N_{\\text{itera}} = 20\\,000` e seed 42."

